    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "body": "Works fine for me:\n```python\nIn [4]: import triton\n   ...: import triton.language as tl\n   ...: import torch\n   ...:\n   ...: big = 2257846272\n   ...: a = torch.empty(big + 1, dtype=torch.int64, device=\"cuda\")\n   ...:\n   ...: @triton.jit\n   ...: def kernel(ptr):\n   ...:     tl.store(ptr + 2257846272, 0xdeadbeef)\n   ...:\n   ...: kernel[(1,)](a)\n   ...: print(f'{a[big].item():x}')\ndeadbeef\n```",
    "created_at": "2025-05-09T13:05:21Z",
